Package: draft
Title: Interactive Inline Reporting Helper for R Markdown and Quarto
Version: 0.0.1
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Authors@R:
    person("Rob", "Cavanaugh", email = "rb.cavanaugh@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Launches a local Shiny app that reads objects from the current R session
    and makes it easy to write traceable inline R Markdown / Quarto reporting text.
    Users can browse model parameters and data summaries, write prose with live-rendered
    inline values, and copy raw inline code for pasting into their documents.
